# Fusecheck fixture (scripts/fusecheck-check.sh --selftest): malformed bound
# grammar — each LINE fails the manifest parse before any geometry is
# measured.
assert fusecheck-fixtures-separable.stl 2 1   # max < min
assert fusecheck-fixtures-separable.stl 2 x   # non-numeric operand
# Mandatory negative control.
control fused 1
